    {
      "text": "Not all protein powders are created equal. If desired, adjust shake consistency by adding more or less liquid per package instructions. This recipe will make about 8 cups of shake. Work in batches to best fit your blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Place milk, water, protein powder, cherries, dates, cocoa powder, vanilla, cinnamon, and salt in a blender. Blend on high speed for several minutes until smooth."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide shake between glasses, adding ice if desired. Enjoy!"
